{"text": "You think I am mad. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But you should have seen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How wisely I worked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was never kinder to the old man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than during the whole week. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Before I did it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every night, about midnight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I turned his door handle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And opened it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Oh, so gently. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I put in a dark lantern. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All closed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So that no light shone out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It took me a whole hour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To put my head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Inside the opening. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Would a madman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Have been so careful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I opened the lantern. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just a crack. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a single thin ray. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fell upon the vulture eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I did this. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For seven long nights. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the eye was always closed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So I could not do the work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because it was not the old man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who troubled me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But his Evil Eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And every morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I went boldly into his room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How he had slept.", "alignment": {"characters": ["Y", "o", "u", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "m", "a", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "s", "e", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "o